    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Saddhā hiriyaṁ kusalañca dānaṁ, ",
      "english": "“Faith, conscience, and skillful giving "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Dhammā ete sappurisānuyātā; ",
      "english": "are qualities true persons follow. "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Etañhi maggaṁ diviyaṁ vadanti, ",
      "english": "For this, they say, is the path of the gods, "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "Etena hi gacchati devalokan”ti. ",
      "english": "which leads to the heavenly realm.” "
    },
